        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitamioki Miriam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etukurra Miriam o Aron Musa te nkaraki ina kitok oo Lkushi nayama, amu entito oo Lkushi apa eyamua; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejo ninche, “Ke Musa aa ninye ake eirorie Olaitoriani? Keitu sii ninye eirorie iyiook?” Nening Olaitoriani ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa ilo tung'ani oji Musa naa oltung'ani obor oleng alang iltung'ana pooki ootii oriong enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nabo kata nejoki Olaitoriani Musa o Aron o Miriam, “Entupuku wootu, intae pokira uni atua ilo ng'obor le ntumo.” Neipang'u pokira uni aapuonu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedou Olaitoriani alotu kop te ng'ape neitashe te kutukaji o lng'obor, neipot Aron o Miriam, nepuonu pokira are dukuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye, “Entoning irorei laainei: Tenaa ketii oloiboni atua intae, ore nanu Olaitoriani makewan naitayiolo kewan ai ninye te nduata nairorie ninye te nkidetidet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 3.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mme neijia to sinka lai Musa; ninye eishooki enkaji ai pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ninye kairorie nanu kiwalikino too nkutukie, te nkibalakinoto, neme te nkiroroto misil; naa keing'or ninye eneikununo Olaitoriani. Kainyoo naa pee miurere intae aatukur ilo sinka lai Musa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyupuyup engoro o Laitoriani ti alo ninche, nelo aing'uaa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ake pee eiwuang ina atampoi te shumata ilo ng'obor, ng'ura, nejing Miriam enkeeya oo lbolot naibor anaa enturoto. Neibelekenya Aron aing'or Miriam, naa ng'ura, etijing'a ninye enkeeya oo lbolot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Aron Musa, “Oi lo kitok lai, mintame iyiook amu kitaasa iyiook te modai, nikitaasa eng'oki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mincho ninye etiu anaa enatua, naidaa nkiri o sesen apa pee eiu ng'otonye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishiraki Musa Olaitoriani, ejo, “Nchiunye ninye, Na Ai, aatasayia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.5.2+NUM.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 5.2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake etiaka Olaitoriani Musa, “Amaa naaji tenaa ketonotaka menye miriam enkomom enye, aimekurru ninye nkolong'i naapishana? Nchoo ninye eikenori ti auluo ilng'oborri nkolong'i naapishana, ore te siadi ina neidimi aanyaaki aaitijing'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eikenoyioki apa Miriam ti auluo ilng'oborri nkolong'i naapishana, neitu edumunye iltung'ana aapuo o metaba anaa neitokini aaitijing'u Miriam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ina nedumunye iltung'ana aapuo te Haserot nepuo aaun ilng'oborri ti ong'ata e Paran.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
